This product includes software developed by the Parapet contributors.

Parapet implements the SecLang rule language. SecLang originates with
ModSecurity and is used by the OWASP Core Rule Set. Parapet contains no
ModSecurity or Coraza source code.

The conformance suite in crates/parapet-conformance exercises Parapet against
the OWASP Core Rule Set (https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset), which is
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The Core Rule Set is not distributed as
part of this repository; the conformance suite fetches it at test time.

